Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.14,0:00:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.62,0:00:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Raising our voices we take\Nin the beautiful blue world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.84,0:00:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sails all unfurled!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.98,0:00:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,La la la la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.70,0:00:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are in between\Nthe sea and the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.42,0:00:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready now for adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We're itching to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.92,0:00:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to roam!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So all aboard now we're set to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.94,0:00:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Set sail to the ocean so deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.08,0:00:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready for a truly grand adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.30,0:00:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well don't you think\Nthat sounds really fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All this excitement is second to none.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.20,0:00:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Raising our voices we take.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.06,0:00:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,In the beautiful blue world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.30,0:00:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.18,0:00:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.92,0:01:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sales all unfurled.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.26,0:01:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,La la la la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.08,0:01:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's something that\NI just won't ever forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.68,0:01:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the way that I felt\Nwhen our journey was set.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.26,0:01:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I won't be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.84,0:01:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I keep that feeling there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.18,0:01:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,With that, let us keep up the pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.44,0:01:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,While enjoying every\Ntrip from place to place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Our timid hearts get the rhythm ingrained.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.12,0:01:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's keep going, adventure awaits.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.58,0:01:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures await.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.88,0:01:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.40,0:01:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.72,0:01:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in\Nhand, everybody rejoices.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.26,0:01:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Party on, cause we stand tall and proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is adventurous, be\Naware it's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.04,0:01:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's gonna be one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And a trip goes on because.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the pirates of the mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.26,0:01:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,To the west, to the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:02:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta find my way, sail away,\Nall the way to one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.76,0:02:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring all your dreams with\Nyou, now fill the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.24,0:02:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In your heart, spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And believe that you can soar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let the breeze guide the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Till you're ready to start up once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're ready for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.28,0:02:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices, party on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.82,0:02:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we stand tall and proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.50,0:02:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.41,0:02:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If we keep going forward after that,\Nwe'll hit a giant refrigerator.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.00,0:03:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the last place we saw Moria.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.70,0:03:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.16,0:03:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Perona was supposed\Nto take care of you, miscreants.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.56,0:03:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr. Hogback!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.90,0:03:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.81,0:03:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A reindeer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.80,0:03:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But why is it talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.48,0:03:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The infamous Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.84,0:03:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hogback, I presume.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.70,0:03:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy was hanging out with Moria.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.88,0:03:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I better kick his ass too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.26,0:03:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not be hasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.08,0:03:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.02,0:03:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a bone to pick with this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.06,0:03:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me fight him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.10,0:03:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You see that big metal door behind you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.64,0:03:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That leads to the refrigerator.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.22,0:03:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.56,0:03:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.18,0:03:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.64,0:03:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just ignore me\Nand waltz your way to Moria?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.20,0:03:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Get them Shandora.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.64,0:04:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that coming out of you? See,\Ndream go on ahead, captain, you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.52,0:04:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.86,0:04:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to stop\Nignoring me. I called back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.86,0:04:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no right to call\Nyourself a doctor anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.60,0:04:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I've lost all respect for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,False! False! False!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.66,0:04:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't recognize you\Nat first, Dr. Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.68,0:04:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So you have Zoan-type\NDevil Fruit powers, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.56,0:04:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I must admit you're a\Nfascinating creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.22,0:04:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how you\Nmanaged to escape after
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.24,0:04:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,they carried you through Perona's garden,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's irrelevant now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.56,0:04:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I found you again, and I won't\Nlet you get away a second time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.28,0:04:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Your shadow will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.18,0:04:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.30,0:04:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather I should have that interesting\Nbody of yours turned into a marionette?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.22,0:05:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, finally, what is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.68,0:05:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.18,0:05:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.76,0:05:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.88,0:05:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing is too freaking huge, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.10,0:05:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And look at those horns!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.72,0:05:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he climb up from hell or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.50,0:05:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.52,0:05:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really a zombie!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.24,0:05:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.56,0:05:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, it's all over, he's gonna grind\Nus up and make meat pies out of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.90,0:06:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.64,0:06:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.80,0:06:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, now I look like the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.90,0:06:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy King of the Pirates\Nwithout an awesome hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, that sure was scary\Nwhen that building fell down
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.02,0:06:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.12,0:06:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me that\Nthing didn't even notice us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.60,0:06:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe, but it really\Ndoes act like Luffy, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.38,0:06:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Something that huge with his fighting\Npower is going to give us hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.74,0:07:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's just get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys don't need your shadows, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.72,0:07:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Like hell we don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.94,0:07:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I did give up on\Nmy shadow, which is stupid,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.62,0:07:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,by the way, we'd still have to\Nrescue Nami, so get your ass up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.00,0:07:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The problem right now is that\Nwe're all stuck down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.36,0:07:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The stairs were the only surefire\Nway to get where we were going,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.64,0:07:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and they're completely destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.02,0:07:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And even if we changed our\Nroute and take this passage,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.84,0:07:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,we're still screwed since\Nthe bridge got taken out too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.08,0:07:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, we can't get to that\Nmansion with the mast either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.62,0:07:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's way too far for us to jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.86,0:07:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We had a shortcut laid out for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.84,0:07:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we're gonna have to go\Nsome scary way full of zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.02,0:07:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.42,0:07:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.04,0:07:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not happy with how\Nthis railing turned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.14,0:07:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You built a bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.76,0:07:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There was wood and scraps everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.96,0:08:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If I couldn't throw together a bridge\Nor two, I'd be a damn disgrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.38,0:08:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, if you say so, but\Nfor a makeshift bridge,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.76,0:08:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,you should put a lot of\Neffort into the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.58,0:08:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're saying you want me to do a\Nhalf-assed instruction job, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.54,0:08:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, don't hear me complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.30,0:08:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.64,0:08:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.74,0:08:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What is a princess live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.54,0:08:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I was\Nexpecting, but it wasn't this
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.42,0:08:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I was going to have my zombies grab\Nyou at the stairs by the bridge,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.06,0:08:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but I suppose that plan fell through.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.42,0:08:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ors was just reborn, and\Nhe's already a nuisance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.74,0:08:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My patience is running very thin tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.14,0:08:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's those ghosts again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.66,0:09:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So I was her controlling\Nthem all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.90,0:09:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are those things anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.10,0:09:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, is that fear I sense in your voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.52,0:09:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't blame you after\Nwhat happened last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.18,0:09:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can create ghosts at my command with\Nthe power of the hollow, hollow fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.62,0:09:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You can think of them as a\Nsort of extension of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.08,0:09:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They can empty your heart\Nand crush your spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.44,0:09:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be fun, for me at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.68,0:09:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this little cutie is the\None making those annoying ghost creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.96,0:09:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Save your comments for another time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.24,0:09:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If we get hit by even one of those\Nthings, it's all over for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.32,0:09:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right! We gotta run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.44,0:09:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose my dignity again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.10,0:09:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Negative Hollow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.18,0:10:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dumber than a mackerel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.12,0:10:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I should just die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.34,0:10:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, Brogy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.30,0:10:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish a straight dog would step on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.62,0:10:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I should just crawl around on the\Nground like a worm and eat dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.64,0:10:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.98,0:10:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Capture them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.94,0:10:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that was easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.96,0:10:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All that's left are the three above us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.34,0:10:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Cat-Blake Salt-Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.92,0:10:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.34,0:10:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my crew, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.88,0:10:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you hurt them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.84,0:10:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Tricky punk, you acted like you got\Nhit just so you could surprise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.74,0:11:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Negative! Ha-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.04,0:11:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Captain Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.32,0:11:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.54,0:11:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't my attacks do anything to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.62,0:11:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I didn't miss that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.56,0:11:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.48,0:11:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of power have you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.50,0:11:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Power has nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.68,0:11:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I just naturally have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.34,0:11:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A NEGATIVE PERSONALITY!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.94,0:11:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's even more negative\Nthan the negative ghosts!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.16,0:11:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a real piece of work!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.14,0:11:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.05,0:11:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mistress Perona!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.64,0:12:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.42,0:12:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No human is immune to\Nthe negative hollows!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.34,0:12:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They have the power to empty your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.36,0:12:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So long as humans are alive, they're\Nalways looking toward the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.58,0:12:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,moving forward one step at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.74,0:12:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But this man, he...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.04,0:12:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.50,0:12:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.36,0:12:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.52,0:12:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your best! Don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.72,0:12:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't pity me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.18,0:12:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to step out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.86,0:12:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta go rescue Nami and get the\Nshadows back before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.90,0:12:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how strong you are, you\Ndon't stand a chance against her!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.46,0:12:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,All you can do is run.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.84,0:12:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry, I'll\Ntake care of her for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.66,0:12:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.36,0:12:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp actually looks cool for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.58,0:12:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is his heart really that empty?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.96,0:12:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Little turd.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.92,0:13:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but please defeat all\Nthe zombies before you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.88,0:13:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Valiant though I may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.38,0:13:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I must conserve my energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.28,0:13:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.32,0:13:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.23,0:13:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.15,0:13:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to beat the zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.42,0:13:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do that part of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.10,0:13:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.66,0:13:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you Absalom
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.58,0:13:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,promise to take Nami\Nas your lawfully wedded
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.30,0:13:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,wife to have and to hold\Nin good times and in bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.18,0:13:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,in sickness and in health?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.10,0:13:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.50,0:13:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you, Nami,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.10,0:13:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,promise to take Absalom as your husband to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.76,0:13:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,have and to hold in good times and in bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.42,0:13:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,in sickness and in health?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.02,0:13:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, I sure do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.92,0:13:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.72,0:13:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you may now kiss the bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.74,0:14:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That last one must have been a dud.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.22,0:14:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,With this final attack, you'll lose\Nevery last bit of your will to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.32,0:14:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, quadruple negative\Nattack, negative hobbles!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.40,0:14:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.96,0:14:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He took all four ghosts at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.76,0:14:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,For as long as Thriller\NBark has floated on the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.70,0:14:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There's never been a spirit that couldn't\Nbe broken by the negative ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.66,0:14:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The negative ghosts\Nhave lost in negativity!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.40,0:14:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kuma, I'm sorry for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.22,0:14:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, even Mistress Perona's\Ngetting negative now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.94,0:14:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.46,0:14:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The patron saint of\Npessimism or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.52,0:14:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's freaking me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.52,0:14:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now listen up,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.58,0:15:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no one not anyone in this entire
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.24,0:15:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,world who can defeat me in negativity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.98,0:15:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that was a close\None. If he hadn't been
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.82,0:15:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,there that would have been\Nthe end for all of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.32,0:15:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty scary power she's\Ngot that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.68,0:15:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey I'm gonna run on ahead and\Nrescue Nami on my own. Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.58,0:15:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck. Go kick some ass. Oh, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.40,0:15:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got the power of love on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.80,0:15:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Nani? Swan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.84,0:15:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get married to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.42,0:15:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, aren't we pretty high\Nup for him to jump like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.98,0:15:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe, but don't forget,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.60,0:15:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,when the adrenaline kicks in, you\Nwon't feel the pain until later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.66,0:15:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, let's get to\Nthe top of that mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.04,0:15:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.95,0:15:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where the skeleton guy is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.12,0:16:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You rise up like you're a phoenix or\Naround here a bit more like a zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.52,0:16:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter. You won't be\Nable to stand much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.84,0:16:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure you stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.06,0:16:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,down for good this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.82,0:16:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No more of these pointless\Nefforts to get your shadow back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.08,0:16:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now tell me what part of\Nthat wretched excuse for
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.36,0:16:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,a body would you like me\Nto sever with my arrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.66,0:16:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Not slash.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.57,0:16:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know the first\Nthing about that technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.34,0:16:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no right to even speak its name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.26,0:16:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to serve in my\Nkingdom's raider squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.90,0:16:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The quick draw attack at\Nwhich I was most skilled
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.68,0:17:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,was originally called the\NRequiem the Banderole.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.12,0:17:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.03,0:17:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,my comrades in arms renamed it in regard\Nto my own sword fighting technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.94,0:17:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They called it Three Verse\NHumming Arrow Notch Slash.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.04,0:17:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you share my\Npersonality and my techniques,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.92,0:17:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You've forgotten my memories\Nand all the feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.38,0:17:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,attached to them which means\Nyou will not use that name!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.72,0:17:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well if those memories and\Nfeelings make you the real thing
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.88,0:17:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,why don't you do something about\Nit come take down the fake!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.98,0:17:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be your last chance to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.32,0:18:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sword Technique 3 verse humming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.84,0:18:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrow not slash.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.92,0:18:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.96,0:18:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Naboo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.92,0:18:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,More than anything else, I\Njust want to apologize to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.44,0:18:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm drifting,\Ndrifting all for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.92,0:18:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.16,0:18:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.42,0:18:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.96,0:19:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, while you're making up your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.98,0:19:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll start with this afro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.80,0:19:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.04,0:19:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire mansion is shaking! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.02,0:19:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.44,0:19:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Rumbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.35,0:19:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.27,0:19:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.18,0:19:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably just an earthquake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.09,0:19:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the laboratory?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.46,0:19:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.62,0:19:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the skeleton guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.32,0:19:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.98,0:19:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it took quite a beating!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.70,0:19:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're still alive, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.18,0:19:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.56,0:19:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I dreaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.74,0:19:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.62,0:19:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This won't do!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.70,0:19:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It all how dare you try to\Ninterfere with our battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.88,0:19:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.44,0:19:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, are you the legendary Samurai\Nthat slayed a dragon in ancient times?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.38,0:20:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been hoping to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.38,0:20:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.14,0:20:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to get the closet kissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.82,0:20:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kind of a big moment here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.16,0:20:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Absalom. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.62,0:20:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with all this shaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.72,0:20:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Thriller Bark has been caught\Nup in some strange current.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.64,0:20:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're being thrown around\Nall over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.70,0:20:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole island is shaking
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.56,0:20:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How did that happen? Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.46,0:20:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,probably because the\Nspecial zombie is moving
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.72,0:20:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,the rudder without\Npermission What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.14,0:20:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.10,0:20:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.12,0:20:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Zombie Generals, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.76,0:20:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.67,0:20:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out there, find Ours,\Nand stop him no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.64,0:20:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,OARS!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.64,0:21:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough out of you,\Nspecial zombie, Oars.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.16,0:21:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.58,0:21:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Start with defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.72,0:21:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He disappeared. Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.50,0:21:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How could something that big just...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.02,0:21:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere for him to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.50,0:21:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is, above us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.12,0:21:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not really rubber!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.30,0:21:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of everybody getting\Nin the way of my flight time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.44,0:21:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Annihilated?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.35,0:21:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean the entire group\Nthat just left here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.92,0:21:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.32,0:21:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They were squashed flat, all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.48,0:22:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.66,0:22:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Those guys are the strongest\Nzombie division on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.28,0:22:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The zombie general.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.28,0:22:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and he took them out instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.30,0:22:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.12,0:22:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't Orr supposed to be on our side?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.46,0:22:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why is he revolting against us?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.08,0:22:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Zombies are made to be obedient.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.78,0:22:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in their nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.82,0:22:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let him keep\Nup all this rampaging
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.48,0:22:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,around if we don't find a way to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.92,0:22:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll sink the whole island
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.04,0:22:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he one of the Straw Hat pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.22,0:22:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.13,0:23:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He was able to fend off Rium as a tack.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.48,0:23:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know he was so strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.82,0:23:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the three-sword-style pirate\Nswordsman of the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.22,0:23:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You better believe he's strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.24,0:23:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's itching for a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.18,0:23:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If your pride will allow it,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.72,0:23:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he was planning on\Ngetting your shadow back for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.52,0:23:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.43,0:23:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My shadow? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.52,0:23:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I beg of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.12,0:23:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you need to do, please get my\Nshadow back. I'd be ever - Enough already!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.74,0:23:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut the hell up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.26,0:23:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, skeleton guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.80,0:23:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a really interesting-looking\NCotton you've got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.18,0:23:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You have good eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.56,0:23:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is indeed one of the 21\Nlegendary swords of the highest grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.80,0:23:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A famed black blade with\Na reverse wave temperline.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.58,0:23:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's known as the clear autumn wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.50,0:23:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Shusui.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.41,0:23:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider yourself fortunate\Nto cast your eyes on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.12,0:23:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So it is one of the legendary swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.20,0:23:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right. I am lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.54,0:24:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I did expect you to have a good\Nblade, being that you're a samurai and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.80,0:24:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That settles it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.54,0:24:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna beat you and\Ntake that sword as my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.84,0:24:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you are so cool! Oh.
